      "side": 1,
      "message": "The property is `State` (L11); `DetectorState` is the enumeration it is\ntyped as (L34):\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/master/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/State/Leak/Detector.interface.yaml#L11\n\nA consumer reading the interface does not find the state.",
      "revId": "933bdabe2e5edfb0efca0f23fb74f23fd9025b69",
